# Vulnerabilities deliberately not blocking the build.
#
# This file applies to the BLOCKING scan only — the one over what the .hpi actually ships. It is
# not the place to silence the full-tree report, which covers Jenkins core and is informational by
# design; see docs/quality-bar.md.
#
# The bar for what this plugin ships is zero, so this file should normally be empty. An entry is
# only acceptable when all three of these are true, and each one must say so:
#
#   1. The vulnerability is not reachable from this plugin, or there is no fixed version yet.
#   2. There is a link to the upstream issue tracking the fix.
#   3. There is an expiry date, so the exception is revisited rather than forgotten.
#
# Format:
#   CVE-YYYY-NNNNN exp:YYYY-MM-DD
#   # why: <one line>
#   # upstream: <url>
